<title>UK: Reuters names Craven non-executive director.</title>
<headline>Reuters names Craven non-executive director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global news and information group Reuters Holdings Plc said on Wednesday it appointed Sir John Craven, chairman of Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Group Plc, as a non-executive director, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Craven was formerly a member of the managing directors' board of Deutsche Bank AG, Deutsche Morgan's parent, Reuters said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
